  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fixed a CFG007/CFG006 false positive found by evidence-based audit: a Dictionary<TKey, TValue> whose key type the real ConfigurationBinder does not support (anything other than string, enum, or an integral type) is never bound at runtime, so CFG007/CFG006 should never report under its values - but the analyzer only ever checked the dictionary's value type, never its key type. A typo'd key under a Dictionary<Guid, EndpointOptions> value wrongly reported CFG007 even though the runtime binder silently skips the whole dictionary. String-, enum-, and integral-keyed dictionaries keep exactly today's behavior. The generated appsettings.schema.json output is unchanged. Diagnostic IDs and severities are unchanged.",
